 <h3><u>Jiyo matamdaro jiyo</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>ZEHRA KI DUA HO TUM ZAINAB KI SADA HO TUM<br> GHAZI KI VAFA HO TUM KHAALIQ KI ATA HO TUM<br> HAR DAUR ME PHOOLO&nbsp; PHALO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO..(2)</p> 
  <p>JAB JAB BHI SAFE MATAM TUM GHAR ME BHICHAOGE<br> AULAADE PAYAMBAR PE ASHQON KO BAHAOGE<br> MAI DOONGI DUA TUMKO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO..(2)</p> 
  <p>MAHSHAR ME SHAFA AT KI ZAAMIN HU VAFADAARO<br> VAADA HAI MERA TUMSE AYE MERE AZADAARO<br> EK TUM HI TO MERE HO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO..(2)</p> 
  <p>MITNE NA KABHI DENA JAAGIRE AZADAARI<br> HAR DIL PE RAQAM KARDO TAFSIRE AZADAARI<br> AYE MERE AZADAARO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO..(2)</p> 
  <p>MUSHKIL ME KABHI TUMSE MOO APNA NA MODUNGI<br> AYE MERE SHION TUMKO MAI TANHA NA CHODUNGI<br> ZEHRA PE BHAROSA KARO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO..(2)</p> 
  <p>ZALIM KE MAZAALIM SE LILLAH NA GHABRANA<br> MATAM KE MUSALLE PAR JAB CHAHO TAB AA JAANA<br> PAOGE VAHA MUJHKO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>SAR&nbsp; KAT TA HAI KAT JAAYE MAQSAD PE NA AACH AAYE<br> MATAM YE RAHE BAAQI GHAT LUT TA HAI&nbsp; LUT JAAYE<br> BAS KHAUFE KHUDA SE DARO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO..(2)</p> 
  <p>HAR RANJO MUSIBAT SE MAI TUMKO BACHAUNGI<br> HAA ISKE LIYE LEKIN BAS ITNA MAI CHAHUNGI<br> TUM MERE HO SAABIT KARO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO..(2)</p> 
  <p>ASIF HAI YE LAB PE DUA MERE MAALIK AYE MERE KHUDA<br> JAB JAAUN MAI KARBOBALA TAB AAYE YE AAMIR SADA<br> JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO<br> JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO</p> 
  <p>JIYO MATAMDAARO JIYO JIYO PURSADAARO JIYO..(2)</p> 
